  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TJN-A - Scaling Up Tax Justice</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is aimed at strengthening and embedding the tax justice movement and campaign against illicit financial flows (IFFs) at the national level in Francophone and North Africa. The project is aligned to TJN-A&#x2019;s and its Partners&#x2019; strategies to increase awareness; build alliances; increase capacity; and generate knowledge on tax justice and IFFs.</narrative>
  </description>
